# run -all
# PASS release restarts both modeled PLLs and synchronizes application domains
# PASS boot does not treat KEY3 as GRBL rearm or assume UART ready
# PASS KEY3 asynchronously asserts both application reset domains
# PASS KEY3 asserts Ethernet PLL, DDR reference PLL and DDR IP reset
# PASS PHY, receive synchronizer and MAC reset follow whole-board reset
# PASS CNN/PCB, document, configuration, HXA and both DDR mailbox ends receive reset
# PASS reset invalidates classification cache and center coordinates
